# Optional app and language catalogue. Parsed by lib/apps.sh, never sourced.
#
#   group|<id>|<label>
#   app|<group>|<id>|<* or ->|<label>|<tokens, space-separated>|<flags, comma-separated or empty>
#   lang|<id>|<label>|<tokens>|<flags>
#
# '*' marks the pre-selected favourites. Tokens: name (official repo), aur:name, flatpak:app.id.
# artcraft:ID installs the ArtCraft release package from github.com/storytold/ID (lib/artcraft.sh).
# Flags: multilib (needs the multilib repo), gpu32 (add the GPU's 32-bit Vulkan driver),
# btrfs (only offered when / is btrfs), browser (a web browser; see apps_browser_setup).
# Labels contain no ',' or '|' (gum --selected is comma-separated).

group|dev|Dev
app|dev|neovim|*|Neovim (LazyVim)|neovim tree-sitter-cli wl-clipboard unzip lazygit fd ripgrep nodejs npm|
app|dev|gh|*|GitHub CLI|github-cli|
app|dev|claude-code|*|Claude Code|aur:claude-code|
app|dev|lazygit|-|lazygit|lazygit|
app|dev|docker|-|Docker + Compose|docker docker-compose docker-buildx|
app|dev|vscode|-|VS Code|aur:visual-studio-code-bin|

group|everyday|Everyday
app|everyday|firefox|*|Firefox|firefox|browser
